# Embed page types

Two host-page shapes. Do not mix them.

**Standalone (own page, one bundle, no App Manager):**

- **Fund Centre** — `#fundCentre` / `#fundCenter`, `fundCentre.js` only.
- **Document library** — same pattern when that app exists. It is **not** the product-page `literature` widget.

**Product page (many widgets):**

- `appManager` plus `pageHeader`, `overview`, `performance`, `portfolioBreakdown`, `literature`.
- App Manager publishes `data-input-*` and loads children. Required on product pages only.

Build order unless the user says otherwise: Fund Centre first (including list → product URL), then product-page widgets, then document library.

See root `README.md` (**Page types**).
